# promise: #700
# View ▸ Appearance set to Light or Dark is Arc's one appearance setting (the theme editor's sun and
# moon): every space's sidebar takes its material, a Dark space's as well as a Light one's, and keeps
# its colours (offline Arc 1.172, #455). Automatic gives each space its own Light or Dark back. Until
# 0.1.54 a Dark space's sidebar stayed dark with Cra set to Light, under a light command bar.
